Invoicing DTOs are mapped by InvoiceMapper located in /Mappings/

This is a shared mapping configuration that handles:
- InvoiceResponseDto mapping
- LineItemDto mapping  
- PaymentDto mapping
- InsuranceClaimDto mapping

The mapper is intentionally kept at the root Mappings folder because it's used by multiple feature modules (Invoicing, Reports, and potentially other features).

If you need feature-specific mapping logic, create a new mapper in this folder.
